WEBVTT

00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:31.643
But of course, what is the neural network

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:37.208
that is helping to bridge and build
these different discrepancies?

00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:41.292
(Laughter)

00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:48.393
Fear.

00:04:48.417 --> 00:04:50.268
(Laughter)

00:04:50.292 --> 00:04:52.542
(Applause)

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:59.018
And as we all know,
fear resides in the amygdala,

00:04:59.042 --> 00:05:01.309
and it is a very natural response,